==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|de}} ''cancellarius'', ushers who sat at the lattice work screens (''cancelli'') of a law court; [[Latin]] ''cancelli'', lattice-work placed before a window, doorway, tribunal of a judge or other places.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||Kanzler|f=Kanzlerin}}

# [[chancellor]]
# ''abbreviation of [[Reichskanzler]], [[Bundeskanzler]]''

